  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### How to update the number of trusts made by the same settlor\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 14 Jul, 2021 at 11:15 AM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nSelf Assessment dashboard >> SA900 >> Select client >> Select return >> In the main form click on 'Trust Type' >> Update the field called 'Number of trusts made by same settlor' \n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to update the number of trusts made by the same settlor\n\nHelp Guide:\n\nFrom the Self Assessment dashboard, go into the SA900 tab and then select a client.\n\nYou can either select a return that has already been created to edit it, or create a new return by clicking on 'New SA900'\n\nFrom the main form click on 'Trust Type' and then update the box next to 'Number of trusts made by same settlor'\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188547\">Self Assessment FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to update the number of trusts made by the same settlor\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 14 Jul, 2021 at 11:15 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Location:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Self Assessment dashboard &gt;&gt; SA900 &gt;&gt; Select client &gt;&gt; Select return &gt;&gt; In the main form click on 'Trust Type' &gt;&gt; Update the field called '<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Number of trusts made by same settlor' </span></p><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Video Tutorial:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/c7c2b2d433bf40f1846e9d6e4f4ca77b\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to update the number of trusts made by the same settlor</a></p><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">From the Self Assessment dashboard, go into the SA900 tab and then select a client.</p><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134534931/original/_759XZuGVlqb7VZrLNwdnbqfHvLnux2eww.png?1626256626\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134534931\"></u></strong></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can either select a return that has already been created to edit it, or create a new return by clicking on 'New SA900'</p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\"><br></u></strong></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134535005/original/s-ZkD_uOm_NnPBTRlmoYob9BZ8zn8VjCsw.png?1626256739\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134535005\"></u></strong></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">From the main form click on 'Trust Type' and then update the box next to '<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Number of trusts made by same settlor'</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134535961/original/Rms4PmwRScWGgyys1KERnE2DbaYAT22_ng.gif?1626257534\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134535961\"></u></strong><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204417\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204417/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204417\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204417/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204417\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
